# Outline API access for integrations/publish-docs.sh
#
# Copy to secrets/outline.env and fill in. Gitignored; mode 0600.
#
# How to get the token:
#   1. open Outline (http://<host>:8090) and sign in with the magic link it
#      mails to Mailpit (http://<host>:8025)
#   2. the first account to sign in owns the workspace
#   3. Settings -> API tokens -> create a token with these scopes ticked:
#        collections.list
#        collections.create
#        documents.list
#        documents.create
#        documents.update
#   4. paste it below. A missing scope is reported by name rather than
#      silently skipping documents.
OUTLINE_API_TOKEN=
